# Transmutation bonus chance — 2026-10-05

Changed the combined additional reward chance from 3% to 10%, preserving the 15:10:4:1 ratio between bonus outcomes.

## Files modified

- `source/scripts/game/loot.lua`, `recycleRewards`: `sphere_mi` changed from `15/1000` to `15/300` (5%); `sphere_pop_materials` from `10/1000` to `10/300` (3⅓%); `sphere_pop_legendary` from `4/1000` to `4/300` (1⅓%); `sphere_pop_divine` from `1/1000` to `1/300` (⅓%); `nothing` from `970/1000` to `270/300` (90%).
- `resources/Scripts.arc`: rebuilt with the existing `tools/pack_beutekugel_scripts.ps1` and installed into the mod.

